  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 17, 2026 at 09:11 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: Fortis Hospital, Mulund, has said it is coordinating with its third-party catering provider, <a href=\"/tag/sodexo+india+services+pvt+ltd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sodexo India Services Pvt Ltd</a>, to address <a href=\"/tag/food+safety+violations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">food safety violations</a> flagged by the Maharashtra Food and Drug Administration (FDA), after the regulator suspended the caterer's <a href=\"/tag/food+business+licence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">food business licence</a> following an inspection of the hospital kitchen.The hospital said it had taken serious note of the FDA's observations and directed the service provider to promptly address the concerns and comply with applicable food safety requirements.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“We take the observations raised by the FDA seriously and have directed the service provider to promptly address them and ensure compliance with all applicable food safety requirements. We are coordinating with the service provider to review the corrective measures being undertaken,” Fortis Mulund said in a statement.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The hospital added that alternative arrangements were being made, wherever required, to ensure the uninterrupted provision of safe and nutritious meals to patients and their attendants.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>According to the FDA, its inspection of the Sodexo-operated kitchen found cockroaches, food waste in drainage, fungus-infested food transport containers and rusted knives while meals were being prepared for patients.The action was part of a statewide crackdown announced by the FDA on October 16, during which the licences of 25 food establishments, including hotels, restaurants, bakeries and canteens, were suspended for violations of food safety regulations.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Sodexo India Services holds the food business licence for the kitchen operating within Fortis Hospital, Mulund, the hospital said.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 17, 2026 at 09:11 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 17, 2026 at 09:11 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                            